1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,999
[Music] My name is Anu. I am from Idukki district, Kattappana.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,999
First of all, I thank God and the Holy Virgin Mary. Likewise, from this Kreupasanam altar,

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,999
I want to first ask forgiveness from the Mother. I am someone who first

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,999
learned about Mother through a person who knew about Kreupasanam Mother. But when I heard about it,

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,999
what I thought was, "Oh, the Mother is everywhere." I am someone who never misses Holy Mass even for a day,

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,999
going to church daily. When I was told that so many miracles happen there, at first I thought

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:01,999
it might be some other power. I am a person who rejected the Mother three times thinking like that.

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:13,999
In March 2022, for the first time, I heard about the Mother when I was going to a hospital.

9
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,999
A sister gave me a newspaper that day. I said I don't need a newspaper; me and my children never miss a day at church.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:27,999
Our church has the intercession of Martin Father and Mother of Immaculate Conception, so

11
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:35,999
I told her looking at her face that I don't need Kreupasanam Mother. After that, I went to the hospital.

12
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:42,999
I was admitted because of a nose pain. That day, while I was lying on the bed, crying like this,

13
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:49,999
an old woman lying next to me came with oil from Kreupasanam and said to me, "Child, I went to Kreupasanam, prayed, and brought this oil.

14
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,999
I will mark a cross on your forehead with it." I still said no, I don't need it.

15
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:04,999
After that, a sister brought this newspaper to my bed, and when my younger sister started buying it,

16
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,999
I told her not to buy it, saying it's a dangerous game. We should just go to our church and pray.

17
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,999
After that, I was discharged and went home. After going home,

18
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:26,999
it was the time I first tried to go to Israel for work. Everything of mine got ready suddenly,

19
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:33,999
and I had money ready. It was my first time going to Bombay. After reaching Bombay, my problems

20
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:41,999
started there. Like the previous testimony said, sometimes difficulties come so much

21
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:49,999
that it helps us understand about the Mother and pray closely to the Holy Virgin.

22
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:56,999
After I went there, three or four people went for the interview. When I entered the interview,

23
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:04,999
my passport and certificates were all taken and kept aside by the interview board. I said that I studied hard

24
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:09,999
nursing, with distinction in theory and practical, but they said only my certificate

25
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:17,999
was fake, and they took it away. I did not know what to do.

26
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:25,999
My re-interview was scheduled, and I came back and entered my room. I didn’t speak to anyone; I cried a lot. At that time,

27
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:33,999
there was another young woman from a different district in my room. She asked me, "Sister, is that the newspaper from Kreupasanam?"

28
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:39,999
She said, "Sister, you are going through so much trouble; why don’t you try reading it once?" So I bought that newspaper, read it, and prayed.

29
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:46,999
In the prayers of light and candles here, I prayed that I would be able to go to Israel.

30
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:53,999
I said this and did it. After that, I called Kreupasanam from here.

31
00:03:54,000 --> 00:04:01,999
After calling, I received a phone call telling me to pray. After that,

32
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:08,999
my re-interview was canceled. When the re-interview was scheduled, people there said, "Has anyone had their re-interview schedules two years ago? Did their certificates

33
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:15,999
and passports get completely blacklisted?" At that moment, I remembered my Mother—how much I suffered,

34
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:22,999
how much I studied and got certificates, but still, I couldn’t go there. Thinking that, I sat there deeply distressed. That night,

35
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:31,999
I had a dream that a registered courier was coming in my name. I was standing below the church I always attend when the courier arrived.

36
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:39,999
I opened the courier with my right hand, and inside I found a colored scapular of the Mother. That’s how I dreamed it. When I got it,

37
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:45,999
I was overwhelmed. I thought, "God, Mother, the one I saw — was it blue in color or the Mother here who is silver in color?

38
00:04:46,000 --> 00:05:06,999
Why did I get a colored scapular? Is some misfortune going to happen to me?" I asked everyone in my group who was in Bombay with me,

39
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:13,999
but everyone said they didn’t know. Nobody knew. Then there was a sister from Alappuzha who was called a ‘maya’ (seer). That sister told me,

40
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:20,999
"Don’t worry at all. The Mother showed you the dream and connected it with Her blood tears.

41
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:26,999
The Mother is interceding to the Holy Trinity for you." That sister said this,

42
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:33,999
and I believed her. I prayed to the Mother and said, "Mother, please help me pass the re-interview and go there."

43
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:38,999
She gave me three days’ time and said I could come to Kreupasanam.

44
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:49,999
I went there and was interviewed by two people, and then by a consulate officer.

45
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:54,999
That day, I was very clear even though I don’t know English well — I studied in Malayalam medium —

46
00:05:55,000 --> 00:06:01,999
so I was not fluent in English to speak well. But a great miracle happened.

47
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:08,999
I still believe that the Mother spoke in my place and answered all the questions they asked exactly as needed.

48
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:19,999
Just like that, I was able to answer the questions, and I got my passport released. I went to Israel and started working.

49
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:27,999
When I arrived there, I initially faced severe difficulties at work, but still, I kept praying—praying and praying.

50
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:34,999
I was working in a place called Nadaniya. While I was there, since I never missed Holy Mass,

51
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:44,999
I had a strong desire, Mother, that every time, every week, I could get six hours to go to Mass in Jerusalem.

52
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:50,999
I prayed there asking for a job transfer so I could attend Mass.

53
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:55,999
When I started working there, that old woman who was with me got weak and after six months.

54
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:00,999
She told me that since I didn’t know Hebrew well,

55
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:05,999
they terminated me from there. After being terminated, I cried bitterly and thought,

56
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:10,999
“Mother, even now I don’t know English well or Hebrew. What am I going to do?”

57
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,999
While crying like that, I read the termination letter they gave me. It said,

58
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:20,999
“Our mother tongue is Hebrew. The caregiver doesn’t know Hebrew well, so there is a communication problem.

59
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:26,999
That is the only reason we are replacing her.”

60
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:31,999
All the agencies I went to gave very good feedback about me.

61
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:37,999
Because of that, in Jerusalem, everyone, including my coworkers and those currently working there,

62
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:43,999
gave me a job with double the salary. I got that job.

63
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:50,999
I felt like a member of that family. They treated me like their own and gave me every comfort.

64
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:58,999
I came here hoping for a house. During the 2019 flood,

65
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:05,999
the hill behind our house collapsed, and all our property was destroyed. We only had the clothes on our backs.

66
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:12,999
But the Lord gave us, through the intercession of the Mother and the Holy Trinity, a house.

67
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:20,999
I now have two houses, and we own three-four acres of land where we live.

68
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:27,999
With blessings worth 1.5 million rupees, the Mother brought me here and made me reach this point.

69
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:33,999
Because of that, I am so moved. When the Mother was with me, I always remembered, "Mother, everyone only gets 45 days of leave."

70
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:38,999
When my fourth child was nine months old, I went to Israel. Now she is three years old.

71
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:45,999
I need one or two months of leave, and I prayed to the Mother asking for it.

72
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:50,999
Since I was there at that time, I used to read the Bible, pray, and chant the rosary beads.

73
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:55,999
I was told to say whatever I wanted and do everything. At the place where I worked, I had complete freedom.

74
00:08:56,000 --> 00:09:06,999
So, as soon as I asked, they immediately gave me two months’ leave. They said, “Anu, you go home, no problem.

75
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:12,999
You don’t have to provide even a reliever. We ourselves will arrange someone to cover.”

76
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,999
I happily took the two months’ leave and went home. After coming on leave,

77
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:25,999
I always felt in my heart, “Mother, on the 1st of May, when I go home, I want to go to Kreupasanam and give my testimony.”

78
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:37,999
But maybe because of the blessings the Lord gave me here, I forgot my Mother. That is the truth.

79
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:42,999
Even after coming here, since so many people were giving testimonies,

80
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:48,999
I kept thinking, “How can I come forward and give my testimony in front of so many?” I don’t know what it was.

81
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:53,999
So I did not come to give my testimony. Then on the 16th of this month,

82
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:58,999
I had bought a return ticket to go back. Everything was packed, the kids included. I was very happy.

83
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:04,999
On the day, I packed all the bags to leave and called my employer to tell them I was coming back.

84
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:13,999
After all arrangements were ready, on the 13th, the war between Israel and Iran started. The war began.

85
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:22,999
Because I had a good salary, I had saved some money and was planning to come here for a month or two.

86
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:32,999
But then I looked, and I had enough money to stay for one or two months in hand. After that, what would I do?

87
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:40,999
I have four children studying. Suddenly, I felt mentally disturbed. I had no appetite for two days.

88
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:45,999
I called my employer, but they didn’t answer. I didn’t know what to do.

89
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:55,999
While I was like that, on the 15th, a sister named Jayasamma called me. She is in New Zealand now.

90
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:59,999
At that time, she was my friend Jyothis, who had completed nursing.

91
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:03,999
She was facing terrible difficulties in her home.

92
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:08,999
She came to Kreupasanam to pray. Jayasamma called me last and said,

93
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,999
“Come to Kreupasanam, Jyothis and I will pray with you and give testimony.” After that,

94
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:18,999
even though she didn’t attend a single interview or have any agency, she went to New Zealand.

95
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:23,999
After six months, she got her PR (permanent residency) there.

96
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:31,999
Then I felt that I was disobedient to the Mother and ungrateful for all the blessings she had given me,

97
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:36,999
and that is why the Mother made someone tell me this. That day I...

98
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:42,999
Suddenly, I prayed to the Mother: “Mother, please forgive me. Forgive me for all the mistakes I have made.

99
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:49,999
If I make mistakes, Mother, how can I expect the children to forgive me? So, Mother, please let me come alive to Kreupasanam tomorrow.”

100
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:57,999
I told myself that I would come to Kreupasanam with my life. On the 16th of this month, I came here.

101
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:03,999
On the morning of the 16th, when I was supposed to catch my flight, I left home and came to Kreupasanam again to renew my covenant.

102
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:11,999
When it was time to go to my work in Jerusalem, I returned home instead.

103
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:18,999
I came here last Monday, renewed my covenant, and then left. But even after that, on Tuesday,

104
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:24,999
I participated in the online meditation by the respected Father Joseph. That day, Father said:

105
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:36,999
“There is a reason why we renew six covenants here. The first miracle Jesus performed at the wedding in Cana was with six water jars.

106
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:45,999
Likewise, Jesus created heaven and earth in six days, and the seventh day was a day of rest.

107
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:51,999
So if you believe for six days, if you pray with faith, your wishes will come true.”

108
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:58,999
From that day on, I began praying sincerely again and started reading the Bible.

109
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:04,999
That day, I told the Mother all my troubles and hardships as I would tell a close person.

110
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:13,999
I didn’t want to tell anyone else. So I prayed: “Mother, Father said six days, right?”

111
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:20,999
Then a friend called me and said, “Hey, you went to Kreupasanam and prayed, right?”

112
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:29,999
By last Saturday, she asked me, “Hey, after you went to Kreupasanam, did the Mother do any miracle for you or not?”

113
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:38,999
I told her, “I was there only for one day, and on the sixth day after I came, they gave me my re-entry permit which expires on the 23rd.

114
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:44,999
After the re-entry expires, I won’t be able to go back to Israel anymore.

115
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:53,999
So, before my re-entry expires, I need to get it renewed.” That was the first thing I was concerned about.

116
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,999
But then the war started.

117
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:02,999
Even after the war began, on the sixth day, I still fully believed standing at this altar.

118
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:10,999
On that sixth day, they told only civilians in Israel to evacuate, and part of the airport was partially opened.

119
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:18,999
On the very day my re-entry permit expired—the 23rd—an order came from the Israeli consulate.

120
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:32,999
They announced that for everyone who couldn’t return during this war, their re-entry permits would be automatically extended until July 31.

121
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:40,999
They said this to me, and I have that official paper in my hands now.

122
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:45,999
My family sent it to me. After that, Mother sped up all my matters greatly.

123
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:51,999
That day, Father also said one thing — if there are things even you cannot do,

124
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:57,999
once you believe and pray about them, if you believe, you will see the greatness of God.

125
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:04,999
That was said in the meditation. I believed and prayed. Likewise, for all my friends here

126
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:10,999
who could not go and could not get their flights rescheduled,

127
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:18,999
even before leaving home today at 4 AM, my phone confirmed my ticket for the 2nd.

128
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:25,999
They told me I could go back, and Mother arranged everything so that not a single rupee left my hands.

129
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:30,999
I said I would go via Jordan. My family told me not to go that way, saying it would be difficult.

130
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:37,999
They said there were risks. But without a rupee leaving my hand, Mother arranged my ticket

131
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:41,999
and schedule, and blessed me.

132
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:47,999
Similarly, my eldest son was a bit behind in studies. When I came here two years ago,

133
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:53,999
I had prayed for him, saying, “Mother, help him study well.” Now he is in 10th class,

134
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:59,999
studying, and he is ranked second in his school. I have four children. Of the remaining three,

135
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,999
they are studying well, ranking first in their schools. Likewise, I had terrible anger,

136
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:10,999
uncontrollable anger. When I got angry,

137
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:19,999
I would take salt and recite my declaration of faith. I had many, many, many

138
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:30,999
changes in my character. Mother gave me many blessings. The blessings Mother gave in two years

139
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:37,999
are so many, I feel one day would not be enough to tell them all. Likewise, Mother,

140
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:41,999
asking the Lord, brought me to the doorstep of fortune.

141
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:49,999
From now on, I will not show disobedience to Mother. That must have happened in a human way.

142
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:55,999
I ask Mother for forgiveness again. Then, the papers I got here — I came from Maharashtra and made my first

143
00:16:56,000 --> 00:17:01,999
covenant there. At that time, I got Kannada and Malayalam papers. I gave the Malayalam papers

144
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:07,999
to everyone there, but since I do not know Kannada, I took the Kannada papers to the church

145
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:16,999
and gave them to the Kannada-speaking people there. Thus, God did many good things for me. Then,

146
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:22,999
if someone close to me comes with a problem or tells me something, through me...

147
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:29,999
In ways I could, I have helped them. Besides teaching my children, I am also teaching another

148
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:38,999
child. Also, Father Joseph said one thing in the meditation —

149
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:46,999
not only should you grow physically at this age, but you should also grow spiritually. I know that I am spiritually

150
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,999
a child. If on my part, anything wrong has happened near my Mother, near the Lord,

151
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:57,999
I have corrected it and now I am making a covenant to live forward.

152
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:08,999
The Gospel of John, chapter sixteen, verse twenty-four says, "Until now you have asked for nothing in my name. Ask, and you will receive,

153
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:13,999
so that your joy may be complete."

154
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:19,999
This great assurance that whatever we ask in Jesus’ name we shall receive,

155
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:23,999
is what we get through this covenant.

156
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:32,999
Anumol was a very proud person who was a very good Christian and the Mother is present in all churches,

157
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:41,999
including my church. So why should I imitate the Mother of Kreupasanam or go there to pray?

158
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:47,999
Why read their paper? My church also has good circulation, and my church also has the Mother.

159
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:55,999
So I do not need the Kreupasanam paper. Even when my sister and friends were in this hospital,

160
00:18:56,000 --> 00:19:05,999
one person who poured oil and prayed with the holy oil here even disturbed the sister. That person is now, with great love for the Holy Mother,

161
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:14,999
asking forgiveness and with great blessings, today that daughter is standing at the altar. She received many great blessings.

162
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:22,999
The covenant which was somewhat loosened and forgotten by Anu was a great

163
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:28,999
testimony of her life. She was taken to Israel and terminated there,

164
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:36,999
then moved to Jerusalem, where she received many blessings, a car, a house, all comforts. After that,

165
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:44,999
she drifted a little away from the Mother and lived only in her happiness thinking, "I have all this."

166
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:49,999
Remembering that moment when she forgot Jesus, she has now come running here,

167
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:56,999
giving testimony and asking Jesus for forgiveness and saying thanks. When we share Jesus’ love,

168
00:19:57,000 --> 00:20:02,999
we know that only then can we forgive and love Jesus.

169
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:11,999
Jesus, who loved us and bore our wounds on the cross, gave us great love through all his work and circumstances. He has no language,

170
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:19,999
but He knows how to love. Through the covenant, the Holy Mother taught everything to the daughter. The daughter said,

171
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:26,999
"I have a spiritual thirst to grow. Whenever I get angry, I take holy salt, put it in my mouth, and my anger..."

172
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:34,999
I used to control it. I am very amazed. Sometimes when anger arises, I wonder if we have the patience

173
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:41,999
to contain it. I keep thinking, this daughter has received so much grace through the covenant.

174
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:47,999
Those who take the covenant, through dreams, through rainbows, through feasts,

175
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:54,999
the Mother is always near, through fragrant anointing and everything. Today the great experience

176
00:20:55,000 --> 00:21:02,999
that the Mother is near us is being received by Anumol. All the useless knowledge she had before,

177
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:08,999
she has now put behind and is journeying towards eternity. Let us pray for Anumol. For all the

178
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:15,999
internal, worldly, and material blessings she has received, let us give thanks. Likewise,

179
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:19,999
for those who are suffering, unemployed, distressed, and all children who are abroad, let us

180
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:24,999
pray. Let us thank Jesus and the Holy Mother for all the blessings and graces received by Anumol,

181
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:33,999
and with a good applause, let us dedicate this testimony. These extraordinary divine experiences

182
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:39,999
can also be yours. If you have not subscribed to this YouTube channel yet, subscribe now. Share this video

183
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:45,999
immediately with your friends and become a messenger of the Lord.

184
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:50,000
[Music]
